    "body": "@domfarolino Could you expand on your 👎 vote? Do you see a benefit in restricting the property name to the generic word?\r\nIdeally, the spec should even provide a link to arguments for that restriction. Currently, I can only see the risk/cost.\r\nThe only argument I found in this thread is that other APIs use the generic name, but that's not a good reason in itself. The other APIs hopefully have good reasons of their own, maybe that in *their* specific context only one kind of signal makes sense.",
